docs {
  # getGatewayId

  Get Gateway item- and serial numbers.

  ## Required service level

  `none`

  ## Body

  `none`

  ## Response

  `200 OK` (Id)

  ### Example

  ```json
  {
	"SerialNumber": "2450D00133",
	"ItemNumber": "8298350"
  }
  ```
}

